> Simple examples

The switch fixture is small enough to check all sixteen entries. Its signed two-channel companion isolates the backward gating rule.

> Executed architecture diagram

The diagram below is generated by this model's forward function through
`nn::Module::plot`. Each style runs a zero-valued shape probe in inference mode;
it does not fit parameters or load a trained checkpoint. Shapes include the
example batch, and learned-value counts deduplicate shared tensors. The flow and LeNet views use named composite blocks; the graph view shows
functional layers and their actual branches. `ModelPlotDetail::Operations`
expands both into tensor primitives.
All views run left to right with node labels rotated 90 degrees counterclockwise.
Colors identify layer categories and are explained by the legend. The settings below
control fill/edge opacity, category colors, column/lane spacing, label content, font
size and wrapping. All views label names and exact shapes; aggregate learned-value counts remain in the heading. All three views use shared linear shape scales: face axes
follow spatial dimensions, depth follows channel count, and vector height follows
feature count. Batch size is excluded from geometry. A one-pixel visibility floor
keeps very small dimensions visible; it is disclosed in each figure. The scales can
instead use `SquareRoot` or `Logarithmic` compression explicitly. LeNet sheet counts
and graph neuron markers are bounded samples; their envelopes follow the shape scales.
Graph neuron bundles are drawn only for actual dense connections. Dots mark omitted
units. Wide diagrams can be scrolled at native size on the website.
Arrows follow the executed differentiable path; constants and deliberately
detached paths are not expanded. The visual conventions are inspired by
[VisualTorch's examples](https://visualtorch.readthedocs.io/en/latest/usage_examples/index.html).

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/zfnet_architecture.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <filesystem>
#include <print>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  n::set_num_threads(2);
  std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
  n::ParameterStore      p(17);
  n::models::ZFNetConfig cfg;
  cfg.image_size    = 67;
  cfg.classes       = 10;
  cfg.width_divisor = 4;
  cfg.dense_width   = 256;
  n::Module model(
      [&](const n::Tensor& image) {
        const auto out = n::models::ZFNet(p, image, cfg, false);
        n::model_stage("Conv 1", image, out.convolution[0]);
        n::model_stage("Pool and LRN", out.convolution[0], out.normalized[0]);
        n::model_stage("Conv 2", out.normalized[0], out.convolution[1]);
        n::model_stage("Pool and LRN", out.convolution[1], out.normalized[1]);
        n::model_stage("Conv 3", out.normalized[1], out.convolution[2]);
        n::model_stage("Conv 4", out.convolution[2], out.convolution[3]);
        n::model_stage("Conv 5", out.convolution[3], out.convolution[4]);
        n::model_stage("Pool", out.convolution[4], out.pooling[2]);
        n::model_stage("FC6 / ReLU", out.pooling[2], out.fc6);
        n::model_stage("FC7 / ReLU", out.fc6, out.fc7);
        n::model_stage("Ten logits", out.fc7, out.logits);
        return out.logits;
      },
      "ZFNet / report configuration");
  for (const auto style :
       {n::ModelPlotStyle::Graph, n::ModelPlotStyle::LeNet, n::ModelPlotStyle::Flow}) {
    n::ModelPlotOptions options;
    options.style                 = style;
    options.opacity               = .8;
    options.edge_opacity          = .55;
    options.funnel_opacity        = .08;
    options.colors.convolution    = "#64B5CD";
    options.colors.pooling        = "#5ABF9A";
    options.colors.dense          = "#748BCB";
    options.spacing.layer = 24;
    options.spacing.lane = 12;
    options.labels.type = n::ModelPlotLabel::NameAndShape;
    options.labels.size           = 13;
    options.labels.wrap           = 28;
    options.sizing.spatial_scale  = n::ModelPlotScale::Linear;
    options.sizing.channel_scale  = n::ModelPlotScale::Linear;
    options.sizing.spatial_size = 96;
    options.sizing.channel_size = 42;
    options.sizing.minimum_extent = 1;
    options.sizing.max_planes     = 6;
    options.detail =
        style == n::ModelPlotStyle::Graph ? n::ModelPlotDetail::Layers : n::ModelPlotDetail::Blocks;
    const auto diagram = model.plot(n::zeros({1, 67, 67, 3}), options);
    if (diagram.parameter_count() != p.count())
      return 1;
    std::string output = "build/zfnet_architecture.svg";
    if (style != n::ModelPlotStyle::Flow)
      output.insert(output.size() - 4, style == n::ModelPlotStyle::Graph ? "_graph" : "_lenet");
    diagram.save_svg(output);
    const auto label = style == n::ModelPlotStyle::Graph   ? "Graph / layers"
                       : style == n::ModelPlotStyle::LeNet ? "LeNet / blocks"
                                                           : "Flow / blocks";
    std::print(
        "{}: {} nodes, {} distinct learned values.\n",
        label,
        diagram.nodes().size(),
        diagram.parameter_count());
  }
}
